From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:54:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/51] fix-data-3: D-38 a Fellow rank is Staff+ and its posted
 pay is shown; Data Residency is not a residency

isFellowRank (server/salary.js) is shared by the level rule (keywords.js), the gate's junior class and
role family (vet.js) and isFixedTermRole: Google's 'Fellow, Core AI Foundations' is Staff+ and its posted
$550,000 passes the gate. Audit of every board: it is the only junior_high quarantine; Google's 'Engineering
Manager, Data Residency and Fast Compliance' was the one other title levelled Intern by a non-programme word.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
(cherry picked from commit 8a443a06e97587667b16ed0e593a2ff4959c728b)
